    "gradient": {
      "$description": "CSS-gradient kraft textures \u2014 resolution-independent, zero rasters. Lit flat washes + vignette via linear/radial-gradient; grit via paper-fiber SVG, no repeating stripes. Alphas capped at 0.14 so the kraft cardboard reads lit over warm kraft-tan bases (#F0E4D4 / #E8D5BE / #DFC9AC); those tans stay light enough that bearBrown #3B2316 body text holds WCAG AA (~7:1+). No backdrop-filter (Safari text-blur bug).",
      "kraft": {
        "$description": "Layered kraft-paper texture set \u2014 replaces the stretched raster kodiakcakes CDN .webp background with pure CSS.",
        "surface": {
          "$type": "gradient",
          "$value": "linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 248, 240, 0.14) 0%, rgba(255, 248, 240, 0.05) 28%, rgba(255, 248, 240, 0) 55%), linear-gradient(#F0E4D4, #EAD9C4)",
          "$description": "Lit kraft card surface \u2014 soft top-light wash over a warm kraft-tan base (#F0E4D4 \u2192 #EAD9C4). No repeating stripes: depth comes from light + shadow, grit from paper fiber. bearBrown #3B2316 body text holds WCAG AA on the warm tan."
        },
        "background": {
          "$type": "gradient",
          "$value": "linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 248, 240, 0.10) 0%, rgba(255, 248, 240, 0) 40%), radial-gradient(120% 90% at 50% 0%, rgba(255, 248, 240, 0) 55%, rgba(59, 35, 22, 0.10) 100%), linear-gradient(#E8D5BE, #DFC9AC)",
          "$description": "Corrugated-cardboard page ground without stripes: top-light wash plus a soft ambient edge vignette over a deeper kraft-tan base (#E8D5BE \u2192 #DFC9AC). Three layers so the body 5-layer stack (2 house washes + 3 token layers) keeps its size/repeat discipline. bearBrown #3B2316 body text holds WCAG AA on the warm tan."
        },
        "surfaceHover": {
          "$type": "gradient",
          "$value": "radial-gradient(90% 90% at 100% 0%, rgba(232, 83, 14, 0.12) 0%, rgba(232, 83, 14, 0) 55%), linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 248, 240, 0.10) 0%, rgba(255, 248, 240, 0) 50%), linear-gradient(#F0E4D4, #F0E4D4)",
          "$description": "Interactive variant of surface: warm blaze-orange #E8530E bloom (0.12 alpha, top-right corner) plus top-light over #F0E4D4. No stripes. bearBrown #3B2316 body text holds WCAG AA on the warm tan."
        },
        "sheen": {
          "$type": "gradient",
          "$value": "linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 248, 240, 0.08) 0%, rgba(255, 248, 240, 0) 44%, rgba(59, 35, 22, 0.05) 82%, rgba(59, 35, 22, 0.08) 100%)",
          "$description": "Top-light sheen \u2014 a directional overlay that reads as a lit surface: a soft white highlight rolls off the top edge (0.42\u21920 across the top 44%) then a faint bear-brown shade settles into the bottom (0.05\u21920.10). Composited ABOVE gradients-kraft.surface on render tiles + captions so headline/caption text sits on a lit kraft surface, not flat parchment. White highlight is decorative only; caption text (bearBrown #3B2316 or neutral-600 #6B5A53) sits in the lower band where the surface stays warm-tan, so WCAG AA (>=4.5:1) still holds."
        }
      }
    },
